  "description": "A .NET 10 Backend-for-Frontend for single-page applications using YARP and standard OpenID Connect. Encrypts Redis session data directly with jose-jwt, forwards user access tokens to configured APIs, and coordinates refresh and logout across replicas. Compatible with OpenIddict.",
