  "published": "2026-10-30T07:09:49.413Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "SPA activation requires PublicOrigin: an orphaned client secret no longer enables BFF. Native YARP works without SPA profiles or BFF secrets. Package-owned named CORS policy preserves host middleware order. Existing Redis instances and ownership are retained across service aliases. Unified native/BFF routing and gateway trace propagation are supported. Backend cookies are isolated by client and cluster using __Host-Http- cookies with Path=/ and server-side backend path validation. Legacy __Secure- bridge cookies are ignored; restart pending OAuth connections after upgrading all replicas.",
